<title>7 · What the sieve is wired to — Sixty Years Later</title>
<meta name="description" content="Lem designed a machine to grow scientific theories the way an egg grows an organism, and staked it on leaving formal computation behind. The automation arrived from inside the formalism instead. What survives is his one rule the 2026 record keeps breaking: the sieve has to be wired to the phenomenon.">
